## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (1)
- `GET /usersync/criteodsp/{criteodspToken}` — Authenticate with Criteo DSP.

### Data Read (20)
- `GET /{id}/sodar` — Retrieve SODAR data by ID.
- `GET /ad/p/in/v1_0/imp` — Retrieve ad impression data.
- `GET /adx/cm` — Retrieve ADX CM data.
- `GET /bc/{bcId}` — Retrieve data by BC ID.
- `GET /bc/banner-main/stw_kcar2021_50` — Retrieve main banner data.
- `GET /bc/homeService/main` — Retrieve home service main data.
- `GET /bc/kw/active/promo` — Get active promotional keywords for business categories.
- `GET /bc/stockCar/list` — Get a list of stock cars.
- `GET /bc/themeCar/bnner-by/car-list` — Get a list of cars featured in a theme banner.
- `GET /bd/{bdId}` — Retrieve details for a specific business data entry.
- `GET /cam/fetch-slot/{fetch-slotId}` — Fetch data for a specific slot.
- `GET /ds/{dId}` — Retrieve data by D ID.
- `GET /dsp/user/sync` — Synchronize user data.
- `GET /nac/2` — Retrieve data from NAC endpoint 2.
- `GET /nac/2/4Cp1B8wgViAI` — Retrieve specific data by ID.
- `GET /pagead/conversion/{conversionId}/` — Retrieve conversion data for a specific ad.
- `GET /sid/json` — Retrieve SID data in JSON format.
- `GET /sync` — Synchronize data with an external system.
- `GET /v1/cm/{cmId}` — Retrieve data for a specific CM ID.
- `GET /v1/usersync` — Retrieve user synchronization data.

### Data Write (5)
- `POST /api/v3/data/` — Write data to the kcar system.
- `POST /b` — Submit a booking request.
- `POST /bc/wish-yn-list` — Update the wish list status for a set of items.
- `POST /p/c` — Submit a car posting.
- `POST /tags/v2` — Create or update tags for content.

### Search (4)
- `GET /bc/search/model-ranking` — Get the ranking of car models.
- `POST /bc/search/group` — Search for car groups based on specified criteria.
- `POST /bc/search/group/mnuftr` — Search for car groups using specific criteria.
- `POST /bc/search/list/{listId}` — Search for cars within a specific list.

### Core API (1)
- `GET /common/getSvrTime` — Get the current server time.

